  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">為 <a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/productivebees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Productive Bees</span></a>&nbsp;添加模組化蜂箱</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ppgAfY3yF\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord 伺服器</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/10/show.png\" alt=\"main\" width=\"769\" height=\"718\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">模組化蜂箱為 3x3x3 的結構。您可自由搭配各種蜂箱組件進行建造，以達成最高生產效率。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/12/blocks.png\" alt=\"parts\" width=\"769\" height=\"673\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">它新增了強大的升級組件，並以其獨特機制來加速或優化蜂箱的生產。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/23/gui_alveary.png\" width=\"769\" height=\"723\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
